{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game is simple, Cut down all the trees.....  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimalist game about restoring nature\u2019s balance in an overgrown forest  With only your axe and determination, carve a path through dense vegetation, collect valuable wood, and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the roots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chop Down Trees</strong> \u2013 Clear the overgrowth and shape the environment around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather &amp; Sell Wood</strong> \u2013 Collect resources to trade for better tools and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Axe</strong> \u2013 Start with basic tools and work your way up to more powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Stamina</strong> \u2013 Pace yourself to avoid overexertion and injury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Hidden Secrets</strong> \u2013 As you cut deeper into the wilderness or the ruins, uncover the mysteries buried beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore &amp; Reclaim</strong> \u2013 Transform the landscape, bringing life back to forgotten places</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3556760?t=1751290992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/353b53cdac476100bbe22e81907d441d72613e0d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751290992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/fb2137ae0ff210400c1862e65d54c63ee35af2d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751290992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/fb2137ae0ff210400c1862e65d54c63ee35af2d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751290992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/extras/wishlist_english_gif.gif?t=1751290992\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Game is simple, Cut down all the trees.....  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimalist game about restoring nature\u2019s balance in an overgrown forest  With only your axe and determination, carve a path through dense vegetation, collect valuable wood, and uncover the secrets hidden beneath the roots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chop Down Trees</strong> \u2013 Clear the overgrowth and shape the environment around you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather &amp; Sell Wood</strong> \u2013 Collect resources to trade for better tools and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Your Axe</strong> \u2013 Start with basic tools and work your way up to more powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Stamina</strong> \u2013 Pace yourself to avoid overexertion and injury.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Hidden Secrets</strong> \u2013 As you cut deeper into the wilderness or the ruins, uncover the mysteries buried beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore &amp; Reclaim</strong> \u2013 Transform the landscape, bringing life back to forgotten places</p></li></ul>","developers":["LimeYee"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556760/af1e4865c6f1eedfcbecd7c768